rly_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124275592", "author": {"steamid": "76561199199940028", "personaname": "밤하늘의궤적〆", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zhutoupiqin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 12518, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8256, "last_played": 1780843469, "avatar": "ee5cc428258a2f7f5775ae66f8bbcde744738e44"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "快更新武器和怪物啊 难受死了 好玩但是模式感觉有点少了", "timestamp_created": 1666534362, "timestamp_updated": 1666534362, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124270641", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099937459", "personaname": "七海千秋", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DeathlEss430/", "num_games_owned": 704, "num_reviews": 318, "playtime_forever": 58435, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12173, "last_played": 1765609772, "avatar": "3b7a4d7c348baf5f08ba6244bc88e3cb4d4111aa"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "可以自由破坏地形的1-4人合作第一人称射击游戏。\n游戏以挖矿为核心玩法，定期有异虫进攻，围绕挖矿和杀虫具有4个职业：\n持有钩爪并提供照明的侦查（点灯的）、\n提供高处临时落脚点的工程（打板的）、\n持有便携式挖掘机的钻机（挖洞的）、\n可以布置固定滑索和范围护盾的枪手（给盾的）。\n[hr][/hr]\n和同类游戏鼻祖L4D2相比，不能通过创意工坊自建地图，也没有PVP模式；但是优点是地图是随机生成的，并且可以自由破坏地形。\n单局时长通常为10-20分钟，很适合抽空玩一会，不像喋血复仇，单局时长越拖越长，最后丝毫没有打开的欲望……\n[hr][/hr]\n良心游戏，DLC只有皮肤，购买本体即可，推荐一玩，也很耐玩。\n2023/11/22：爱的付出提名", "timestamp_created": 1666527524, "timestamp_updated": 1700662153, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.53125", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124261728", "author": {"steamid": "76561198970813455", "personaname": "橘沨", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198970813455/", "num_games_owned": 224, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 30152, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 24951, "last_played": 1779461807, "avatar": "10a7d24c024dfd234c74b8c878fa70c942f1a099"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "早知道，还得是刷宝游戏\n可单人挑战，可组队冒险\n难度自调，可休闲可高难\n价格优惠，除了dlc其他都可游戏内获得\n版本更新天天更\n买入不亏\n————————————————————————\n神中神", "timestamp_created": 1666513800, "timestamp_updated": 1732773669, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}